# BuildKit per-Dockerfile ignore (WO-121): read *only* because packages/server/Dockerfile is built with
# the repo root as context (`docker build -f packages/server/Dockerfile .`) — a plain `.dockerignore`
# next to the Dockerfile is not consulted in that case, only `<dockerfile-name>.dockerignore` at the
# context root (SDD-006 "Local y despliegue"). Paths below are relative to the repo root.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage
**/*.log

.git
.gitignore
.github

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.claude
.prdm/*.lock
.prdm/engine.lock
.prdm/journal-*.json
.prdm/graph-stale
.prdm/drafts

packages/web/test-results
packages/web/playwright-report
packages/web/blob-report
packages/web/playwright/.cache
